>From what i can tell from reading the source:

- the d4 is added to the normal weapon damage. Relevant source:
mhitu.c:549 - it's a loop of all moster attack types. If it has a claw
attack it will use it every time. If it has a weapon, and is close
enough, etc, it will get to use that too.

- no strength bonus. Relevant source: mhitu.c:905 ish is where the
calculation for monster damage with weapon starts. I don't see anything
about a strength bonus.

- when it has no weapon the claws still attack  (so d4 in this case)

caveat: i'm not an expert on the nethack source, but i'm pretty sure
these are the right answers. 

